+ PatternBackgroundPainter is Painter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Painter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

canvas.fill-color = node.$background-color
canvas.stroke-color = null
canvas.rect(rect)
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#312e81")
canvas.circle(rect.x + 36, rect.y + 38, 92)
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#0e7490")
canvas.circle(rect.right - 24, rect.y + 130, 116)
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#7c3aed")
canvas.rect(Rect(rect.x + 34, rect.bottom - 94, rect.width - 68, 56))

