+ AccentBorderPainter is BorderPainter

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is BorderPainter ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ border-insets
    - node Box

Insets(8, 16, 12, 6)

────────────────────
+ do paint
    - node Box
    - rect Rect
    - canvas Canvas

. edges = node.border-edges
canvas.stroke-color = null
canvas.fill-color = node.$border-color
canvas.rect(Rect(rect.x, rect.y, rect.width, edges.top))
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#f97316")
canvas.rect(Rect(rect.right - edges.right, rect.y, edges.right, rect.height))
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#22c55e")
canvas.rect(Rect(rect.x, rect.bottom - edges.bottom, rect.width, edges.bottom))
canvas.fill-color = RGBA("#38bdf8")
canvas.rect(Rect(rect.x, rect.y, edges.left, rect.height))
